------------------------------EXAMPLE 1 => Handling Ties in Rankings (RANK vs DENSE_RANK)

"Generate a ranking of customers in Spain based on their credit score, 
handling potential tied values using DENSE_RANK() so that identical scores receive the same position without skipping subsequent ranks."

SELECT 
    Surname,
    CreditScore,
    DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY CreditScore DESC) AS Rank_Credit_Score
FROM Customers
WHERE Geography = 'Spain'
ORDER BY Rank_Credit_Score ASC;

